/* 889~892 READONLY: 경기별 확정·실패 재처리·구 저장의 결과 기저·관전 예약의 같은 라운드. */
let FC889_BASE=null;
function FC889(){if(!FC889_BASE){__seed(889001);fresh();G.day=G.cal.open+30;while(!flOpenOn(G.day))G.day++;flInit();for(const p of Object.values(G.players)){p.inj=0;p.injOut=0;}for(const t of G.teams){for(let i=0;flPool(t.id,G.day).B.length<10&&i<8;i++){const p=newPlayer({team:t.id,isP:false,pos:i===0?'C':'LF',age:24});p.team=t.id;p.e1=false;p.yrs=1;p.inj=0;p.injOut=0;}}worldReset();FC889_BASE=JSON.stringify(G);}G=JSON.parse(FC889_BASE);worldReset();__seed(889042);return {F:G.fl,d:G.day,r:G.fl.round,P:flPairsR(G.fl,G.fl.round)};}
